<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.78 vs   0.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.26 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.62 vs   0.68</p>
<p> Sales		   18.89 vs  13.43</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.58 vs   6.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.67 vs   7.65</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.25 vs   6.25</p>
<p> Sales		  169.99 vs 112.01</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
